{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_08", "source_id": "68db91b80000000005001e8f", "title": "7日嫩肤跟练～国庆哪都不去，就在家缩毛孔", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68db91b80000000005001e8f", "topic_family": "毛孔与清洁", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1323, "evidence_unit_count": 37, "original_evidence_unit_count": 37, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["这是我为自己准备的7日嫩肤流程，给大家参考一下~我是30岁的油皮，需要的是k老以及皮肤细腻，最近一年多因为仪器+A醇的搭配，毛孔真的肉眼可见小了很多很多", "仪器后的护肤，需要修护的 我会搭配胶原炮，它是胶原直补的，让我缩毛孔和k老的效率更高", "同第三晚 第七晚：胶原炮➕毛孔精华➕褒曼", "30ml/1fLoz. YDUNVIE Acaderma", "原经龄 MOISTURIZER 30ml/1fl.oz.", "这是我为自己准备的7日嫩肤流程，给大家参考一下~我是30岁的油皮，需要的是k老以及皮肤细腻，最近一年多因为仪器+A醇的搭配，毛孔真的肉眼可见小了很多很多", "第一晚：家庭版🌊飞秀 我每周一定会做这个来清洁毛孔垃圾"], "retained_quotes": ["这是我为自己准备的7日嫩肤流程，给大家参考一下~我是30岁的油皮，需要的是k老以及皮肤细腻，最近一年多因为仪器+A醇的搭配，毛孔真的肉眼可见小了很多很多", "第一晚：家庭版🌊飞秀 我每周一定会做这个来清洁毛孔垃圾"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68db91b80000000005001e8f/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68db91b80000000005001e8f/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68db91b80000000005001e8f/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68db91b80000000005001e8f/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "918545b333f7e59dfe9e5f216f540fc1d95ba34594660ada6521a478c1cc5667", "card_hash": "fe2aeef0d829dec8b0d8fe0ab48cb8f5f48b0841227b3e6d5f6f6d14c89a5