{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_08", "source_id": "68d8e916000000000e00d3f7", "title": "6min下饭电子榨菜（护肤博主首闯开箱圈", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68d8e916000000000e00d3f7", "topic_family": "空瓶与产品复盘", "mechanism_key": "list_decision", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 2033, "evidence_unit_count": 64, "original_evidence_unit_count": 64, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 259, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 拆箱来了 攒了半个月的快递 话不多说 马上开拆", "有点高腰的 所以它会把背力显得很好 还是他们家的 比较不好一点", "好可爱呀 现在夹上去 看一下 喂 小熊吗 在我的耳朵上面好好担着哟", "哈哈哈 因为我最近很想要搞 南国的女团的那种 非常非常直的那种头发", "一片狼籍 这片一定要给我点个赞哦", "斗棚式的衣服的 然后我觉得它上身的话 有一点嗶嗶的感觉 所以我再买了它", "这个好像是一件 欧阳娜娜的同款的T恤 我先试一下看看 我觉得这件还不错"], "retained_quotes": ["斗棚式的衣服的 然后我觉得它上身的话 有一点嗶嗶的感觉 所以我再买了它", "这个好像是一件 欧阳娜娜的同款的T恤 我先试一下看看 我觉得这件还不错"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68d8e916000000000e00d3f7/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68d8e916000000000e00d3f7/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68d8e916000000000e00d3f7/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68d8e916000000000e00d3f7/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "c0fba37b80887e3bbc96494973b3304c22cd4a55fab1359edb82d3727c7cae7a", "card_hash": "2a85b149bbb8eda0e8dced6ee0af9a5e96768f8666fa0e03446e5831676f091d", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_08", "source_id": "68d3b9830000000011016341", "title": "大红脸换季自救经验分享（油痘敏肌", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68d3b9830000000011016341", "topic_family": "敏感维稳与红黑脸", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1095, "evidence_unit_count": 33, "original_evidence_unit_count": 33, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 94, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["作为一个曾经大红脸了很多年的油豆饼鸡 每到现在这种患季的时候", "你就会很喜欢这种打圈去揉搓它 所以在以前这种患季的时候 我每次洗完脸就发现脸很红", "透明脂酸纳 B5 鸡血草这种修护成分的 因为它们的模拟皮脂膜", "用也能帮我们维稳 质地就是这种像半透明的 淡青的感觉 我每次就会用一滴管上脸", "在这种换季来临的时候 皮肤又随便闹情绪了", "第一点就是用按压的手法去洗脸 第二点就是用这种又保湿 又不会闷斗的修护产品去强韧品账", "对我们这种肤质来说可能会太润反 而让我们长更多的痘 所以选到合适我们肤质的修护产品非常重要"], "retained_quotes": ["第一点就是用按压的手法去洗脸 第二点就是用这种又保湿 又不会闷斗的修护产品去强韧品账", "对我们这种肤质来说可能会太润反 而让我们长更多的痘 所以选到合适我们肤质的修护产品非常重要"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68d3b9830000000011016341/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68d3b9830000000011016341/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68d3b9830000000011016341/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68d3b9830000000011016341/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "6d05cb9c2aed48ac960c343889a8c729fa1dad26402a7bb7406b1d7fe60fa1f3", "card_hash": "21f2ed74f397f2ac814fe6deb4936b6b2e1e403f1a4342fc9e7d887ecfe4afe6", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_08", "source_id": "68cf82400000000011014e8d", "title": "好皮肤的第一步是去浊气", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68cf82400000000011014e8d", "topic_family": "饮食与状态", "mechanism_key": "time_feedback", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1369, "evidence_unit_count": 38, "original_evidence_unit_count": 38, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["好多姐妹觉得我现在皮肤看起来很细腻、干净、明亮，但其实我以前皮肤状态也是蜡黄、暗沉很多痘痘的状态", "到灵气足的地方，身体自然会被净化 2、喝蔬果露（不滤渣）", "再就是丰盈，我喜欢丰盈饱满的面部，但我天生的体型是偏清瘦的，到了30岁更是感觉脸上胶原少了很多", "Gentle Makeover PEEL", "SERUM 奇迹胶原轻龄 冻干精华液 一周两次胶原灌肤", "如果感觉皮肤被晒黑了或者想要更明亮的状态，就会用⚪️⚪️精华，这个是我最近的新宠，温和、肤感清爽，但效果特别快速", "打了一段时间后，发现确实有改变，首先我来例假前胸一点都不痛了，其次每次打坐完我能切身的体会到什么叫神清气爽，感觉身体畅通无阻"], "retained_quotes": ["如果感觉皮肤被晒黑了或者想要更明亮的状态，就会用⚪️⚪️精华，这个是我最近的新宠，温和、肤感清爽，但效果特别快速", "打了一段时间后，发现确实有改变，首先我来例假前胸一点都不痛了，其次每次打坐完我能切身的体会到什么叫神清气爽，感觉身体畅通无阻"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68cf82400000000011014e8d/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68cf82400000000011014e8d/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68cf82400000000011014e8d/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68cf82400000000011014e8d/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "2195b2ef70e3dad731a52aa9138cbb582b2e91cd914618c824967976448c2c1e", "card_hash": "4d0a6ae9fd95c2c1a106cb1cfb30102952fc3bc447f62fad65828630ed403e6b